  "notes": "Image 1 is the back view; its silkscreen prints the 3.3V-OUT edge pad as 3V3. Buttons (RESET/CHIP_PU, BOOT/GPIO28), LEDs (CHARGE_LED, USER LED/GPIO27) and the external antenna connector were skipped. Battery pad silkscreen is 'BAT' with '-' and '+' signs; callouts read BAT- and BAT+. Battery-management text (GPIO6 ADC sense, GPIO26 enable) is descriptive, not a pin."
